Third-party notices

This driver is adapted from the following works:

- t4v4res/st7735_driver (https://components.espressif.com/components/t4v4res/st7735_driver)
  Copyright (c) 2024 T4V4RES, MIT License.
  Used: initialisation sequence (frame rate, power and gamma values) and the 5x7 font table (src/font5x7.c).

- Adafruit-ST7735-Library and Adafruit_CircuitPython_ST7735R
  (https://github.com/adafruit/Adafruit-ST7735-Library,
   https://github.com/adafruit/Adafruit_CircuitPython_ST7735R)
  Copyright (c) Adafruit Industries, MIT License.
  Used: per-revision panel parameters (colour order, inversion, RAM offsets) and the rotation mapping.

- ESP-IDF esp_lcd ST7789 panel driver (components/esp_lcd/src/esp_lcd_panel_st7789.c)
  SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2021-2024 Espressif Systems (Shanghai) CO LTD
  SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 (http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0)
  Used: structure of the esp_lcd panel driver (src/esp_lcd_st7735s.c).